From 37dc9c07395ee56632bff9ee9b46d174530a5771 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 12:46:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Achievements: rebind to philosophy, wire dead unlocks, real
 ach listing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Refresh the seven existing achievements with Архивариус-voice notes and a
short philosophical hit per name (ПОДПИСЧИК / 47-Й / АРХИВАРИУС / СЛУШАТЕЛЬ /
СВИДЕТЕЛЬ / AMOR FATI / МОХ ПОМНИТ / СЕАНС). Add three new tied to existing
mechanics: ПЯТЫЙ (Cat at all five spots), ХОНТОЛОГИЯ (read .fisher), 47-Й
(read 47 fragments).

Wire the previously-dead three: fire on chai-with-Старец useAction,
moss on a 10-min stillness counter ticked from the main loop, terminal on a
new `terminal.cmd` event emitted by exec(). Fix archivist threshold (57 → 88,
matching the actual lore.js count).

Replace the `ach` terminal stub with a real list — marks, descriptions, the
philosophical line on unlock, and a "X / N collected" footer.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01LVwPreRodjCmwpCk6uZGEa
